Z||000000||falconhulk||10-26-2001||07:46 AM||||Has anyone seen this?  Its in the new Car Craft.  It was the first pontiac to have bolt on panels like the fiero.  it was also pontiacs first 2 seater.  GM squashed it becasue they were afraid it would impact the sales of corvetees.  If looks almost identical to a corvette.  It should as GM took parts of this cars look and used them in later model vette's!!  It also had what looks identical to a 2nd gen firebird rearend.  Only 2 were ever made.  Pick up this issue and take a look.  Also the current issue of High Performance Pontiac has a history of Pontiacs cars.  It includes a few paragraphs and some pics of the fiero.||||reg||1
