Z||000010||Raydar||10-26-2001||11:38 AM||||Kinda hard to tell from the pics, but the Monaro looks a bit large to be a Camaro, unless they shorten the floor pan. More like "Chevelle-sized"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> (Aus, you've seen this car in person. Right?) <BR>Wouldn't hurt my feelings to see a new Chevelle SS, either. And that would go along with the Holden "GTO" badge, too. <P>Am I reaching too much, here?<BR> <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000011||falconhulk||10-26-2001||12:27 PM||||Anybody see the concept GTO at Carlise this year?  I know the at least some of you guys were there with your fieros.  That GTO was awesome.  Only thing I thought would not make it on a production car was the rear end.  I am 6'4' and the back deck probably came up to 1' under my chin.  BTW the banshee dos not look like a vintage corvette (well they borowed a little) but the vette  looks like it!  Chevey borowed things from this car for later vettes!   <P>[<p>[This message has been edited by falconhulk (edited 10-26-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000012||Flamberge||10-26-2001||01:42 PM||||Interesting that the would-be Pontiac 2 seater (64 Banshee) was squashed by Chevrolet. (Don't want any competition, heaven forbid.) History repeated itself with the Fiero. The Firebird was supposed to be a Corvette-killer (not literally, but a very fast 2 seater,) and then the Fiero was too, but both were sterilized and whitewashed and then bleached for good measure too. Too bad Chevrolet didn't succeed, since the Firebird and Fiero are the two best cars GM has ever made, IMO.<P>I believe Pontiac should do it, make a two-seater. A real one. Now is the time. They need a new flagship, they need their identity back, and we need a modern Pontiac that says "fiammegiante!"<P>Be it based on the Opel Speedster or a completely new design, I think it is time we make those Chevrolet guys earn their "we're the best" apples.<P><P>------------------<BR>- Flamberge<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://flamberge.iwarp.com/Serra3sm.jpg"> ||||reg||7
